  "privacyBody": "Eluna Media converts your files entirely on this device using a bundled copy of FFmpeg. Your files never leave the device, no account is required, and there is no telemetry. Nothing in the app uses the network at all — it does not even hold the internet permission.\n\nMetadata removal is on by default, so EXIF, GPS coordinates and timestamps are dropped from the files you export.",
